{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45589","headline":"酷吏词 · 贯休","name":"酷吏词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霰雨灂灂，风号如斸。\n有叟有叟，暮投我宿。\n吁叹自语，云太守酷。\n如何如何，掠脂斡肉。\n吴姬唱一曲，等闲破红束。\n韩娥唱一曲，锦段鲜照屋。\n宁知一曲两曲謌，曾使千人万人哭。\n不惟哭，亦白其头，饥其族，所以祥风不来，和气不复。\n蝗乎蠈忽，东西南北。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}